<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Adsteam year net loss falls slightly.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Adsteam year net loss falls slightly.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating			loss 27.92 vs loss 8.17</p>
<p>    Net				loss 20.99 vs loss 23.24</p>
<p>    Sales				  675.02 vs 1,922</p>
<p>    Other income			 101.09 vs 152.27</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			loss 9.0 vs loss 10.0</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		 loss 11.39 vs loss 30.02</p>
<p>    Tax					1.49 vs 3.93</p>
<p>    Interest				81.39 vs 137.22</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  11.67 vs 35.44</p>
<p>NOTE: The Adelaide Steamship Co Ltd group of companies operate with the agreement of its bank lenders, who were owed A$799.1 million at the end of 1995, down from A$6.07 billion at the end of 1991. The result is reported on a consolidated economic entity basis.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
